---
title: Tomato Soup
servings: 4
prep time: 10 min
cook time: 30 min
source:
  name: Grandma
  url: https://example.com/soup
---

> A family favourite.

Chop @onion{1}(diced) and @garlic{2%cloves}.

Fry in #pot{} with @olive oil{2%tbsp}, add @tomatoes{800%g} and simmer for ~{25%minutes}.

== Finish ==

Blend with @salt{} until smooth.
